 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Gentiles sought no law of works",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.03,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But found the grace they did not seek",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Israel pressed to reach the goal",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Yet fell short of what they took",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.03,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They chased a law by human hands",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.03,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But missed the faith that sets them free",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Stumbled on the stone they saw",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And tumbled in their own decree",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "See I lay in Zion a stone",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A rock that makes them fall and break",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.88,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But the one who believes in him",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.85,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Shall not be put to shame",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.93,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Righteousness by faith is found",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For those who do not chase the prize",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.9,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The law was sought by works alone",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And left the seeker blind to eyes",
